OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786529900
OL,3,CHistoric hotel among 13 sites housing
OL,4,Casylum seekers to close
OL,6,FOne of the oldest hotels in Blackpool
OL,7,Fis among 13 sites that will no longer
OL,8,Fhouse asylum seekers, as Andy
OL,9,FBurnham's Government continues the
OL,10,Fprocess of moving people into
OL,11,Falternative accommodation.
OL,13,FMinisters are increasing their use of
OL,14,Fmore "basic" sites including former
OL,15,Fmilitary barracks, having pledged to
OL,16,Fstop using asylum hotels completely by
OL,17,Fthe next election.
OL,26,@vD@FOUvD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
