OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786529900
OL,3,CHistoric hotel among 13 sites housing
OL,4,Casylum seekers to close
OL,6,FThe closures are expected to save
OL,7,Ftaxpayers #51 million, and brings the
OL,8,Ftotal number below 160, the Home
OL,9,FOffice said ` having peaked at around
OL,10,F400 under the Conservatives.
OL,12,FThe list includes the Grand Metropole
OL,13,FHotel on the Blackpool Promenade, one
OL,14,Fof the two oldest hotels in the town,
OL,15,Fand the grade II-listed Grosvenor
OL,16,FHotel in Stratford-upon-Avon.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786529900
OL,3,CHistoric hotel among 13 sites housing
OL,4,Casylum seekers to close
OL,6,FImmigration minister Anna Turley said:
OL,7,F"For too long, communities have
OL,8,Fwatched hotels at the centre of their
OL,9,Ftowns and cities become symbols of a
OL,10,Fbroken asylum system.
OL,12,F"We are turning that around by ending
OL,13,Fthe use of asylum hotels for good and
OL,14,Fmoving people into larger, basic
OL,15,Faccommodation like former military
OL,16,Fsites.
OL,18,F"This Government's reforms are
OL,19,Foverhauling the immigration system to
OL,20,Frestore control at the border, and
OL,21,Ffairness to our immigration system."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUzD@AOU}D@dO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
