OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786529900
OL,3,CHistoric hotel among 13 sites housing
OL,4,Casylum seekers to close
OL,6,FLabour has already closed several
OL,7,Fprominent sites, including the Bell
OL,8,FHotel in Epping, Essex, which became a
OL,9,Ffocal point for protesters after a
OL,10,Fresident sexually assaulted a teenage
OL,11,Fgirl.
OL,13,FShabana Mahmood stayed on as Home
OL,14,FSecretary when Mr Burnham took over
OL,15,Ffrom Sir Keir Starmer, and there is no
OL,16,Findication of a change of approach to
OL,17,Fasylum hotels.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786529900
OL,3,CHistoric hotel among 13 sites housing
OL,4,Casylum seekers to close
OL,6,FPlans could include housing asylum
OL,7,Fseekers at former military bases at
OL,8,FBarnham in Suffolk, Bicester in
OL,9,FOxfordshire and Linton-on-Ouse in
OL,10,FNorth Yorkshire ` which together could
OL,11,Fprovide accommodation for around 3,750
OL,12,Fpeople.
OL,14,FThe Government is also looking to
OL,15,Fexpand the use of existing sites in
OL,16,FCrowborough in East Sussex until 2030
OL,17,Fand Wethersfield in Essex beyond 2027,
OL,18,Fdespite opposition from locals.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/7
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
