OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,363,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F362A1786529900
OL,3,CHistoric hotel among 13 sites housing
OL,4,Casylum seekers to close
OL,6,FThe Refugee Council's Imran Hussain
OL,7,Fsaid: "Hotels often are isolating for
OL,8,Frefugees, making it harder to access
OL,9,Fhealth and advice services. They are
OL,10,Falso costly and have become magnets
OL,11,Ffor abuse and the far right.
OL,13,F"But an approach that is focused on
OL,14,Fmoving people from hotels to military
OL,15,Fsites will only go so far, especially
OL,16,Fwhen poor quality decision making by
OL,17,Fthe Home Office is keeping a large
OL,18,Fnumber of people reliant on asylum
OL,19,Fsupport and accommodation for far
OL,20,Flonger than is necessary."
OL,26,@oD@GOUuD@AOU|D@ZO]
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/7
